  "body": "Step into exceptional coastal living with this brand-new, standalone four-bedroom home on a freehold title, perfectly positioned on a road-front site with stunning sea views. From the moment you arrive, this home impresses with its modern design, natural light, and elevated sense of space.\r\n\r\nDownstairs, enjoy practical family living with a spacious lounge, a dedicated dining room, and seamless indoor–outdoor flow - ideal for everyday comfort and entertaining. The layout is designed for ease, functionality, and connection.\r\n\r\nUpstairs, take in breath-taking views from the sunny balcony, alongside a second lounge perfect for relaxation or family time. The upper level continues the sense of space and privacy with well-appointed bedrooms and beautifully finished interiors.\r\n\r\nFamilies will appreciate the premium school zones, including Pigeon Mountain Primary, Bucklands Beach Intermediate (BBI), and the highly sought-after Macleans College, all just a short distance away.\r\n\r\nComplete with a double garage, modern finishes, and a prime coastal location, this is a standout opportunity to secure brand-new living at its finest.",
